{title: The Colour of Youth}
{lyricist: Sergio Rykov}
{composer: Sergio Rykov}

{start_of_verse}
We are born and we pass away,
Losing dreams in the daily grind.
Never looking back, we walked as children,
On first-name terms with all the world.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
Colours so bright, songs and laughter.
Wonder comes as sudden as snow.
We keep on smiling and waving goodbye,
Again forgetting the colour of youth.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
A tender melody is shining in your eyes.
Mischievous stories flutter on the boughs.
It's as if I'm drifting back to my childhood years,
Where memory takes me sometimes when we meet.
{end_of_chorus}
